  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mahaweli Water Security Investment Program (Tranche 3)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tranche 3 is aligned with the following impacts: (i) agriculture production improved and economic growth sustained in the North Central Province, Central Province, Northwestern Province and Eastern Province improved; and (ii) food security enhanced. Tranche 3 will have the following outcome: water conveyance systems and agricultural productivity in the project areas enhanced.Tranche 3 is estimated to cost $125.54 million (regular loan of $93 million from ADB&amp;apos;s ordinary capital resources, and government financing of $32.54 million) .</narrative>
  </description>
